The bug in `src/import_merge.ts` was caused by a strict string comparison (`b.url === inc.url`) that failed to recognize URLs with different hostname casing as duplicates.

I fixed this by using the `URL` constructor to compare the protocol, lowercase hostname, pathname, and search parameters. I also added a fallback to strict string comparison to handle cases where URLs might be malformed.

